# Checkpoints are deliberately NOT excluded here. Only the one named by the
# CHECKPOINT build arg reaches the image — the Dockerfile copies application
# files individually instead of `COPY . `, so the others cost context transfer
# but add nothing to any layer. Excluding them by name, as this file used to,
# meant `ARCH=vgg16 ./scripts/deploy-backend.sh` failed on COPY with the checkpoint
# it had just verified was present.

# Training / evaluation tooling and the dataset — never executed inside Lambda.
training/
tests/
requirements-dev.txt
pyproject.toml
*.pages
expressions.txt
